From 6e10f37c4bbbef87801980bd36ef2d3f348ccb38 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: qwen38-4090 <noreply@localhost>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 19:50:16 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 17/49] Two-level head: 3-bit verify-head screen behind
 NINFER_HEAD_SCREEN=3

Half-offset 3-bit G64 copy of the Q8 head (0.48 GiB instead of the 0.64 GiB Q4 copy), per-CTA top-8,
merge to the top-32 per column, exact Q8 rescoring. The exact argmax stays within the screen top-12 on
16k real verify states. Spec-Bench-480: 480/480 outputs identical; same-binary A/B +0.8..1.4% decode.
